          "UNRESOLVED (p.69, p.74-90): inlay plates, lug angles, stiffeners, diaphragms, stitch rivets and the splice plates whose extent was not read - they are listed per joint without extents (133 splice / fill callouts have no length in splices.csv). chord cover / web splice plates and fills with a scaled length are built (connections-ptc.csx); the rest is not built.",
